Package: lightning-l2-launcher
Version: 1.6
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: curl, tar, xz-utils, winetricks, cabextract, unzip, ca-certificates, zenity
Maintainer: Lightning-L2 <admin@lightning-l2.com>
Description: Lightning-L2 Linux Launcher
 One-click launcher for the Lightning-L2 Lineage II High Five private
 server on Linux. Sets up a dedicated Wine-GE + DXVK environment on
 first run, points at your existing Lineage II High Five client
 install, and overlays the Lightning-L2 Linux-compatible system patch.
